;; Russian production calendar (five-day week) 2000-2027: external gold.
;; Regenerate: uv run --no-project --with beautifulsoup4 python -I scripts/generate_ru_production_gold.py
;; :years maps YEAR to one code per day from 1 January:
;;   W working day, R rest day that is not a holiday, H holiday (a statutory
;;   нерабочий праздничный день, or any non-working Monday-Friday).
;; The H/R split on Sat/Sun follows the ТК/КЗоТ holiday list in force
;; (see the script); the work/non-work status comes from the sources.
